IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `uro-nouns`

-- Social Security Benefits Up-rating Order 2026 (S.I. 2026/148): PART 3, ARTICLES 20 TO 22, WITH SCHEDULES 2 AND 3.
-- Layer 1. Article 20 amends the Income Support (General) Regulations 1987 (not among the inputs). Every figure
-- the Order states is a value. The conditions the Order's two Schedules attach to a figure ("falls within any of the
-- circumstances specified in paragraph 1A", "satisfies the condition in paragraph 11(1)(a)") are tests in the
-- Regulations, so each is a plain input named for the fact. The Schedules' own words (aged less than 18,
-- not less than 25, both members, each child) are encoded.
-- Dates: arts 20, 21, 22 come into force on the first day of the beneficiary's first benefit week to commence on or
-- after 6th April 2026 (art 1(3)(g), uro-part1-intro).
-- Article 20(1) ("a reference in this article to a numbered regulation or Schedule is a reference to the regulation
-- of, or the Schedule to, the Income Support Regulations") is a cross-reference convention and is not encoded.

§ `Article 20 -- Applicable amounts for Income Support`

