@ref art 21 (src:215-216)
GIVEN `the special transitional addition to income support` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`art 21: the special transitional addition after the increase of 3.8 per cent` `the special transitional addition to income support` MEANS
    `the special transitional addition to income support` TIMES (1 PLUS 3.8%)

